WEBVTT

1
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:34.200
<v Marcus Bell>They came back with a counter. They want the same seat count but at the old rate, which is twelve percent below what we quoted. Their argument is that they've had three outages this quarter.</v>

2
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:47.900
<v Dana Okafor>Two of those were the upstream provider, not us. We have the incident reports.</v>

3
00:00:47.900 --> 00:01:02.300
<v Dana Okafor>If we're going to give ground on price I'd rather we do it because we want to keep the logo, not because we've accepted a version of events that isn't accurate.</v>

4
00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:14.700
<v Priya Raman>Agreed. I'm willing to go to six percent, not twelve, with the incident report attached so the number reads as goodwill and not an admission.</v>
